1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,264
Nhân vật 1: By the end of the afternoon, the school corridor was empty. I was just going to go back to class to get the forgotten notebook, but this place is darker than I thought.

2
00:00:09,764 --> 00:00:19,028
Nhân vật 1: Ah, the notebook is at the last table! Thankfully, I thought I had lost it. The end-of-day sunlight is still creeping through the classroom window.

3
00:00:19,528 --> 00:00:26,608
Nhân vật 1: Wait... did the door just close on its own? Is there anyone out there? Don't tell me you're here alone!

4
00:00:27,108 --> 00:00:35,940
Nhân vật 1: Whew... just a branch brushed against the glass. I scared myself. Calm down, it's okay to take a little breath on the terrace.

5
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:46,760
Nhân vật 1: What a beautiful sunset. Finally, the notebook was found again, and the fear was probably just because I imagined too much. I have to go home early tomorrow!
